Regarding the design trade-offs, I've chosen to use MD5 as it offers a good balance between performance and resource consumption in this case. For large files, streaming techniques have been used to handle data efficiently. The custom retry mechanism has been implemented using OkHttpClient with a fixed number of retries. However, the reliability and scalability of the retry mechanism under varying network conditions would require further evaluation and optimization based on testing and monitoring results.

